{"id":501300,"shortDescription":"What Remains of Edith Finch es una colección de historias extrañas acerca de una familia en el estado de Washington. Adéntrate en la piel de Edith y explora la gigantesca casa Finch en busca de historias, mientras ella ahonda en la historia familiar y trata de averiguar por qué es el último integrante de la familia que sigue con vida.","developers":["Giant Sparrow"],"publishers":["Annapurna Interactive"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Cromos de Steam","Steam Cloud","Remote Play en TV","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"24 ABR 2017","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/501300?t=1785424558","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501300/ss_5e17b98cf2effabcb74aedc537ef3d68578b5c66.600x338.jpg?t=1785424558","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501300/ss_5e17b98cf2effabcb74aedc537ef3d68578b5c66.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785424558"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501300/ss_b33a742463deb8564a382e1744febceaa91a5bab.600x338.jpg?t=1785424558","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501300/ss_b33a742463deb8564a382e1744febceaa91a5bab.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785424558"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501300/ss_cc50bb10f1858d16a4df684f4dd264bda5d432ba.600x338.jpg?t=1785424558","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501300/ss_cc50bb10f1858d16a4df684f4dd264bda5d432ba.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785424558"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501300/ss_77ebb61562a25dbcd0c4cc1c5090b76a76a055b2.600x338.jpg?t=1785424558","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501300/ss_77ebb61562a25dbcd0c4cc1c5090b76a76a055b2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785424558"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akama